<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
    <key>CFBundleName</key>
    <string>$(PRODUCT_NAME)</string>
    <key>CFBundleDisplayName</key>
    <string>헤르메스챗</string>
    <key>CFBundleDevelopmentRegion</key>
    <string>ko</string>
    <key>CFBundleLocalizations</key>
    <array>
        <string>ko</string>
        <string>en</string>
        <string>zh-Hans</string>
    </array>
    <key>CFBundleIdentifier</key>
    <string>$(PRODUCT_BUNDLE_IDENTIFIER)</string>
    <key>CFBundleExecutable</key>
    <string>$(EXECUTABLE_NAME)</string>
    <key>CFBundleVersion</key>
    <string>5</string>
    <key>CFBundleShortVersionString</key>
    <string>1.0</string>
    <key>CFBundlePackageType</key>
    <string>APPL</string>
    <key>LSRequiresIPhoneOS</key>
    <true/>
    <key>UILaunchScreen</key>
    <dict/>
    <key>UIRequiredDeviceCapabilities</key>
    <array>
        <string>arm64</string>
    </array>
    <key>UISupportedInterfaceOrientations</key>
    <array>
        <string>UIInterfaceOrientationPortrait</string>
    </array>
    <key>UISupportedInterfaceOrientations~ipad</key>
    <array>
        <string>UIInterfaceOrientationPortrait</string>
        <string>UIInterfaceOrientationPortraitUpsideDown</string>
        <string>UIInterfaceOrientationLandscapeLeft</string>
        <string>UIInterfaceOrientationLandscapeRight</string>
    </array>
    <key>NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription</key>
    <string>사진을 Hermes에게 첨부해 보내고, 메타 글라스로 찍은 사진을 자동으로 감지·전송하기 위해 사진 보관함 전체 접근이 필요합니다.</string>
    <key>NSMicrophoneUsageDescription</key>
    <string>음성으로 메시지를 입력하기 위해 마이크 접근이 필요합니다.</string>
    <key>NSSpeechRecognitionUsageDescription</key>
    <string>말한 내용을 텍스트로 변환하기 위해 음성 인식이 필요합니다.</string>
    <key>BGTaskSchedulerPermittedIdentifiers</key>
    <array>
        <string>ai.hermes.chat.refresh</string>
    </array>
    <key>CFBundleURLTypes</key>
    <array>
        <dict>
            <key>CFBundleURLName</key>
            <string>com.hermes.chatios.voice</string>
            <key>CFBundleURLSchemes</key>
            <array>
                <string>hermes</string>
            </array>
        </dict>
    </array>
    <key>UIBackgroundModes</key>
    <array>
        <string>fetch</string>
        <string>audio</string>
        <string>remote-notification</string>
        <string>processing</string>
        <string>bluetooth-central</string>
        <string>bluetooth-peripheral</string>
        <string>external-accessory</string>
    </array>
    <!-- Meta Wearables DAT (T-172) — 글라스 카메라 실시간 스트림. 개발자 모드라 MetaAppID는 0 -->
    <key>MWDAT</key>
    <dict>
        <key>AppLinkURLScheme</key>
        <string>hermes://</string>
        <key>MetaAppID</key>
        <string>0</string>
        <key>ClientToken</key>
        <string></string>
        <key>TeamID</key>
        <string>$(DEVELOPMENT_TEAM)</string>
        <key>Analytics</key>
        <dict>
            <key>OptOut</key>
            <true/>
        </dict>
        <key>CrashReporting</key>
        <dict>
            <key>OptOut</key>
            <true/>
        </dict>
    </dict>
    <key>UISupportedExternalAccessoryProtocols</key>
    <array>
        <string>com.meta.ar.wearable</string>
    </array>
    <key>NSBluetoothAlwaysUsageDescription</key>
    <string>메타 글라스 카메라에 연결해 Live 대화에서 보고 있는 화면을 공유하기 위해 블루투스가 필요합니다.</string>
    <key>NSLocalNetworkUsageDescription</key>
    <string>메타 글라스와 Wi-Fi로 연결하고 Hermes 서버에 접속하기 위해 로컬 네트워크 접근이 필요합니다.</string>
    <key>NSBonjourServices</key>
    <array>
        <string>_bonjour._tcp</string>
    </array>
    <key>NSSupportsLiveActivities</key>
    <true/>
    <key>NSAppTransportSecurity</key>
    <dict>
        <key>NSAllowsArbitraryLoads</key>
        <true/>
    </dict>
    <key>ITSAppUsesNonExemptEncryption</key>
    <false/>
</dict>
</plist>
